    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44278" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĭlus</span></b> , a, um,
		adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>having a broad</i>, <i>turned-up nose</i>, <i>pug-nosed</i>, <i>snub-nosed</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιμός</span> (cf. simus): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ecquos (deos arbitramur) silos, flaccos,
					frontones? etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 1, 29, 80</span></i>
			; ante-class. collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sīlo</span></b> , ōnis,
			m., <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 2, 2, 11</span></i>; Varr. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Non. 25, 25</span></i>.</div>
